WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.690
- I'm here with the
incredible Gabrielle Union

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:04.900
who is on the cover

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.733
of this month's Women's Health magazine.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:09.970
Oh, hello.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:11.610
Oh, and yellow!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.550
That's our signature
color here at the show.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.900
- Oh, I love yellow. That's
one of my favorite colors.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.733
- Okay, so Flawless, your hair care line,

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:28.090
is it true, I read that
in 2017, you launched it,

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.250
but then halted it, took a pause,

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.930
and wanted to relaunch the business

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.840
to a certain criteria
you felt was necessary.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.810
Can you tell me about that?

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.610
- Yeah, we wanted to,

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:41.330
I wanted to wrestle back the company.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.960
I wanted to make it black owned.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.240
I wanted to redo the formulas.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.150
I wanted to partner with
one of my best friends

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.360
and who is also

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.100
an amazing celebrity
hairstylist, Larry Sims,

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.720
and I wanted to make sure that Larry

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.990
was in the lab creating these formulas

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:00.630
to make sure that things actually worked.

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.340
And then once we figured that out,

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:05.520
we wanted to make sure that
it was actually affordable,

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:06.810
and we wanted to make sure

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:10.110
that it was accessible to
as many people as possible.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.550
The first time in 2017,

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:13.650
I was going through
multiple rounds of IVF,

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:15.010
and like a lot of folks

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:17.500
who've experienced IVF, or pregnancy,

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:22.010
or any time you have major
hormonal shifts like menopause,

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:23.500
I had a lot of hair loss,

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.910
and so I wasn't able to
authentically promote the brand

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.070
'cause I was feeling
anything but flawless.

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:32.950
And so the 2020 version,

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:37.563
we have amazing ingredients,
salon quality ingredients,

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.520
we are affordable, and we
are being sold on Amazon

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.340
and now in Sally's.

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.180
And we just wanted to make sure

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:46.460
that the things that worked for me

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.787
are available and accessible
to as many people as possible.

00:01:49.787 --> 00:01:52.370
(casual music)

